.vercel
.env*

# Derived index artifacts, regenerated (and signed) at publish time from
# Packages. Tracking them is what made every parallel branch conflict:
# Release embeds a `Date:` line so it changes on every single regeneration,
# and .gz / .gpg / InRelease are binary or whole-file checksums, so git can
# never merge two branches' copies. Packages itself stays tracked -- it is the
# manifest CI publishes from, and it merges structurally via .gitattributes.
Packages.gz
Release
Release.gpg
InRelease

# Never had a generator in this repo; leftovers from a manual recovery pass.
Packages.pv
Packages.sha
